  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><h3 data-start=\"130\" data-end=\"166\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"134\" data-end=\"166\">About Our Brand and Products</strong></h3><p data-start=\"167\" data-end=\"698\">ROAM Smart Tracker is a premium Bluetooth tracker designed for the modern lifestyle — helping people keep track of what matters most: keys, bags, bikes, pets, and more. With <strong data-start=\"341\" data-end=\"391\">dual-network compatibility for Apple &amp; Android</strong>, <strong data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"411\">built-in strap</strong>, <strong data-start=\"413\" data-end=\"439\">IP67 waterproof rating</strong>, <strong data-start=\"441\" data-end=\"473\">What3Words lost-and-found QR</strong>, and a&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"514\">sleek recycled-plastic design</strong>, ROAM blends smart tech with everyday style.<br data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"562\">Our mission is simple: to make finding lost things fast, easy, and sustainable — all while keeping you connected, anywhere in the world.</p><hr data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"703\"><h3 data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"736\"><strong data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"736\">What Makes Us Different</strong></h3><ul data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"1112\"><li data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"819\"><p data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"819\">Works on <strong data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"797\">both Apple Find My and Android Find My Device</strong> — no brand lock-in.</p></li><li data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"899\"><p data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"899\"><strong data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"839\">Premium build</strong>, eco-friendly materials, and <strong data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"896\">multiple colour options</strong>.</p></li><li data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"946\"><p data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"946\"><strong data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"916\">Rated 4.9★</strong> from 360+ verified reviews.</p></li><li data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"1028\"><p data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"1028\"><strong data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"982\">Exclusive co-branding options</strong> available for partners and corporate gifts.</p></li><li data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1112\"><p data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1112\">Designed and operated from the <strong data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1068\">UK</strong>, now expanding across <strong data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1111\">EU, MENA and USA</strong>.</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1117\"><h3 data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1150\"><strong data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1150\">How Affiliates Can Earn</strong></h3><p data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1475\">Earn&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1174\">10% commission</strong> on every sale generated through your unique affiliate link.<br data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1237\">We provide your audience with a <strong data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1293\">custom discount code</strong> that gives them&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1350\">exclusive savings plus free shipping</strong>, helping you boost conversions while rewarding your followers.<br data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1416\">There’s no limit — the more you promote, the more you earn.</p><hr data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1480\"><h3 data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1507\"><strong data-start=\"1486\" data-end=\"1507\">How to Promote Us</strong></h3><p data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1548\">We make it easy for you to share ROAM:</p><ul data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1886\"><li data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1624\"><p data-start=\"1551\" data-end=\"1624\">Post product reviews or unboxings on <strong data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1621\">TikTok, YouTube, or Instagram</strong>.</p></li><li data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1695\"><p data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1695\">Add your affiliate link to <strong data-start=\"1654\" data-end=\"1692\">blogs, newsletters, or gift guides</strong>.</p></li><li data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1756\"><p data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1756\">Share your <strong data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1733\">unique discount code</strong> with your community.</p></li><li data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1886\"><p data-start=\"1759\" data-end=\"1886\">Use our <strong data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1780\">media kit</strong> — including product images, lifestyle videos, and key talking points — to create high-performing content.</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1891\"><h3 data-start=\"1893\" data-end=\"1918\"><strong data-start=\"1897\" data-end=\"1918\">Other Information</strong></h3><p data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"2292\">ROAM is trusted by travellers, property professionals, and everyday users alike. Our trackers make perfect gifts and promotional products, and affiliates benefit from high conversion rates thanks to our proven product quality and 5-star customer satisfaction.<br data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2181\">We support affiliates with timely payments, regular campaign updates, and early access to new product launches.</p></div>",
